onnementales, avec panneaux photovoltaïques et récupération des eaux de pluie.\nUn bien rare à Toulon, à la fois fonctionnel, élégant et durable.","addr":"266 RUE BONFANTE","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImY3NTk5YmNmYWMyMDEwN2MxNDY2MDI5ZWQ2MWJhYzRkNmU5NGM2ZjciLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJiYzg1OGQ1NmIyZWFhZDBhMzFlMGQzMzYxZWQ5N2Q2MiJ9?signature=2bb48d5a0a306524d6b30a7b2a1f0edc30e36de5b76b5d9081a944efdb7eaf13","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6Ijk5NDg3ZDE5Y2U2MDBlNjQwMmNiMTZiYTI3Nzg2ZTQzNjYyNmRiNzgiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI5ZWUyYmNmN2YwNjE2MTAwOWIwMGQxNTI0MjNiYzY0NSJ9?signature=26c8ff7616c644153aaa2841a9c2e5822705d1d630f384bdc18275395d57a1b9","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjBiY2IyYWQ4ODU2MGQzMzlkZDIyZThlMmI3ZTc2YzVjYjE3MzQ0NGEiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJhNGE0MzRmNDVhMTE4OTE3M2Q1OTk5OWUzODNkNWIzMSJ9?signature=8d3f385509b7f4aa14b74747aa8db5a005a813fde48c0df28313a527e2ba704b"],"yt":[],"vr":[],"logo":"https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182NjY2ZGYzYzZlZTcxIiwiZWRpdHMiOnsicmVzaXplIjp7IndpZHRoIjo4NSwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo4NSwiZml0IjoiY292ZXIifX0sImZpbGVIYXNoIjoidXBsb2FkaW5nXzY2NjZkZjNjNmVlNmUifQ==?signature=66893444d9cf8ece53bef1f580f7b406ddddff19da3b9249c2488783520e3daf","zone":"A","lots":[{"ty":"T2","na":"Appartement","s":42.0,"f":"3","ex":["SO"],"ter":6.23,"pk":1,"pr":[{"tva":5.5,"p":200010.41},{"tva":20.0,"p":227500.0}],"opt":false},{"ty":"T2","na":"Appartement","s":45.0,"f":"4","ex":["SO"],"ter":6.07,"pk":1,"pr":[{"tva":5.5,"p":215395.84},{"tva":20.0,"p":245000.0}],"opt":false},{"ty":"T3","na":"Appartement","